{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FitMaster AI 透過手機鏡頭與人工智能動作分析，將手機變成智能健身教練，適合居家訓練、減脂、徒手健身及高強度間歇訓練的用戶。無論是掌上壓、深蹲、弓步或仰臥起坐，App 都會即時偵測動作並自動計算次數。原價 US $7.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>人工智能動作追蹤</h2>\n<p>透過即時鏡頭分析，FitMaster AI 會自動偵測動作模式，在掌上壓、深蹲、弓步和仰臥起坐等訓練中計算重複次數，無需按鍵或穿戴裝置。另設平板支撐與靠牆靜蹲計時器，提供語音提示、震動回饋、訓練紀錄與表現分析，協助用戶以更佳姿勢持續鍛煉。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-705-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-706-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-707-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-708-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-709-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FitMaster AI: Rep Counter</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T05:59:30.442463+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}